            subtitle: 'Card game',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Mahjong Official Rules, often called MCR, is a standardized competition-focused Mahjong ruleset. It keeps classic Mahjong draw-discard structure while using a formalized scoring catalog for consistent tournament adjudication.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'This ruleset was assembled to provide a unified modern competition framework for Mahjong while preserving core traditional tile-play mechanics.',
              },
            ],
          },
