          objective: 'Complete a valid 14-tile hand and score under the official scoring catalog.',
          gameplay: 'Players take turns drawing one tile and discarding one tile. Discards may be claimed for legal melds by claim priority rules. A hand wins on self-draw or discard claim when structural and scoring requirements are met.',
